  [i] Tower Key: Estus upgrade waiting at Firelink
      The Shrine Handmaid sells the Tower Key for 20,000 souls. The tower holds the Fire Keeper Soul (a permanent Estus heal upgrade when given to the Fire Keeper), the Fire Keeper armor set, and access to the crow's nest for item trading. How to get back: Buy the Tower Key from the Shrine Handmaid at Firelink, then take the left exit to the tower behind the shrine.
  [i] Dark Sigil acquired - Usurpation path is active
      You now carry a Dark Sigil, which puts you on the Usurpation of Fire ending path. To keep it alive: draw all 5 levels from Yoel before he dies, meet Yuria afterward, and do NOT heal the Dark Sigil with the Fire Keeper (that ends the path and Yuria leaves). Hollowing is cosmetic and reversible with a Purging Stone.
