      Two NPCs wait at the Halfway Fortress bonfire: Anri of Astora and Horace the Hushed. Talk to BOTH - Horace gives you the Blue Sentinels covenant, and Anri's questline runs the length of the game (and is REQUIRED for the Usurpation of Fire ending if you're on the Dark Sigil path). Missing this conversation stalls their entire storyline.
  [!] Recruit Orbeck of Vinheim (needs 10 INT)
      Orbeck hides on the second floor of the flooded room that leads to the Crystal Sage fight. Talk to him with at least 10 Intelligence and he moves to Firelink as your sorcery trainer. Below 10 INT, equip the Scholar Ring (Grand Archives is far away - or just level INT to 10) - he only checks once. He is also required later in Yuria of Londor's questline. IMPORTANT: after recruiting him, you must hand him ANY scroll before you defeat ~6 more bosses, or he leaves forever.
  [!] Yoel of Londor / Yuria of Londor: Approaching Farron Keep — Complete Sigil Draws Before Abyss Watchers
      WARNING: You are in the Road of Sacrifices and have begun Yoel's Dark Sigil draws. The Abyss Watchers boss is at the end of the next area (Farron Keep). Yoel of Londor dies permanently when you reach the Hanging Bridge in Catacombs of Carthus. If you have fewer than 5 Dark Sigils, return to Yoel at Firelink NOW and complete the remaining draws before progressing. Hollowing thresholds: 1st=free (done), 2nd=2, 3rd=6, 4th=12, 5th=15.
  [!] Yoel of Londor / Yuria of Londor: Farron Keep — Final Warning Before Abyss Watchers
      CRITICAL: You are in Farron Keep and the Abyss Watchers boss is ahead. This is your last chance to finish Yoel's Dark Sigil draws. Yoel dies permanently when you reach the Hanging Bridge in Catacombs of Carthus (accessible only after Abyss Watchers). If you have fewer than 5 Dark Sigils: warp back to Firelink Shrine RIGHT NOW, die enough times to hit the next Hollowing threshold, and draw from Yoel before coming back. Thresholds: 2nd draw at 2 Hollowing, 3rd at 6, 4th at 12, 5th at 15.
  [>] Missed: Mortician's Ashes (gates Irina's questline)
      You left the Undead Settlement without the Mortician's Ashes. Giving them to the Shrine Handmaid unlocks the Grave Key (1,500 souls), which you need to reach Irina of Carim in the sewers - a miracle vendor with her own questline. How to get back: Warp back to the Undead Settlement. The ashes are in the white-birch graveyard where the Giant's arrows land (talk to the Giant in the tower first so he covers you).
      ... (6 more)
